From 410cfe858a1321b1737b5d7ba61bb2ae35252710 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GuaiYiHu <guaiyihu@foxmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:32:30 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Bluetooth: initialize GD LE state only when the controller
 supports LE

Read BR/EDR extended features before submitting any LE command. On classic-only controllers retain zero-initialized LE buffers, feature fields, advertising counts and vendor capabilities, while continuing BR/EDR initialization and completing the final address promise. On LE controllers wait for LE feature/state responses before querying optional data-length, privacy and advertising capabilities. Keep typed response validation and controller errors unchanged.

Change-Id: I5269fcc6e90bf33a1a3c03c1841234898b7d0b2b
---
 system/gd/hci/controller.cc | 178 +++++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 95 insertions(+), 83 deletions(-)

diff --git a/system/gd/hci/controller.cc b/system/gd/hci/controller.cc
index 72cf8f5018..6e8210d375 100644
--- a/system/gd/hci/controller.cc
+++ b/system/gd/hci/controller.cc
